  {
    "hotel_id": "2235563",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/vyda-backpacker-hostel/hotel/ho-chi-minh-city-vn.html",
    "name": "VyDa Backpacker Hostel",
    "detail": "This has got to be the best place to stay in Ho Chi Minh City! The hostel staff are the most friendliest people I've ever met, the owner is so kind and the facilities are fantastic. Stayed here for a total of 4 weeks for work, and my stay was nothing short of amazing! I actually came back a week later from Hanoi and cancelled my hotel so that I could stay here for two more nights before I went back to Australia to spend time with the staff who became very close friends of mine. They even invited you out to eat with them and made you feel very at home and part of the family! The facilities such as the dorm rooms and beds were neat and presentable, lockers were very handy and toilet facilities were clean. The hostel staff were also very approachable and hospitable, always willing to give suggestions as the best places to eat and also booking day tours and other activities when needed. I highly recommend staying here!",
